[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0010","text":"打扰了\n请问我们家的芹泽有没有来打扰过──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0020","text":"──是吗\n百忙之中打扰您了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0030","text":"不好意思，如果看到她的话能联系我吗\n拜托了，告辞了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0040","text":"！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0050","text":"“喂，制作人？”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0060","text":"冬优子！\n怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0070","text":"事务所和训练室都没有\n我也问了叶月小姐，她说没看到"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0080","text":"“……是吗”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0090","text":"你呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0100","text":"嗯，学校也没有，家里也没有\n其他能想到的地方我也联系过了…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0110","text":"“……以那家伙的性子，\n　我觉得她也就是随便跑到哪儿晃悠去了”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0120","text":"“从失去联系到现在，\n　还没过一个小时吧？”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0130","text":"嗯……\n话是这么说，但是…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_9999","text":"SNS的帖子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0140","text":"“芹泽朝日，如果在我班上绝对是最讨厌的类型”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0150","text":"『………………』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0160","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0170","text":"……唉，要是她嬉皮笑脸地回来说什么“我忘了～”或者“我在那边跳舞来着～”，我可饶不了她────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0180","text":"冬优子酱────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0190","text":"『怎么了？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0200","text":"等一下，爱依过来了──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_07_0210","text":"可能找到朝日酱了！\n我朋友看到了────"}]
